{
  "id": "clean",
  "format": 1,
  "basis": "drawing",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "description": "The clean pipeline look: flat ground and exact lines for the line, Needs you and receipts, one status map with a glyph and a word for each state, an automatic legend, the app's chrome roles in light and dark with a focus ring, sixteen terminal colors per theme, and bundled faces for text, code, math and the Han, Arabic and emoji fallbacks.",
